 "fps": 12,
 "timeline": {
  "death": "f0-1 HIT (form _flash + fx_death_hit) | f2-4 POP (form hidden, fx_death_pop_s/l) | f5-8 PUFF (fx_death_puff; crowned forms add fx_crown_fly f5-10) | f9-10 empty hold | then fx_reborn_tease overlay 1 s -> title card. 11 frames = 0.92 s before the tease.",
